<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES LOWER AT FIX.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES LOWER AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most Helibor interest rates</p>
<p>were lower at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The three-month rate was a shade lower at 3.07 percent.</p>
<p>			   April 15 fix	   April 14 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor	   3.02 pct		3.04 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor	   3.05 pct		3.05 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor	   3.07 pct		3.08 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor	   3.20 pct		3.21 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor	   3.33 pct		3.34 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor	  3.47 pct		3.47 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
